        "text": "Level and mechanisms: the current level is 1.814 million, the four-week average is 1.808 million, and the July 4 initial-claims print of 215,000 argues against a sudden inflow shock. Continued claims can still edge up if hiring/outflows remain slow, so I add a small two-week net increase rather than reverting immediately to the one-year downward drift; the slower-outflows component is judgmental rather than tied to a separate direct outflow release."
